 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Ane no Koto ga Sukina Hittou Majutsushi-sama ni Migawari de Totsuidara, Naze ka Watashi ga Dekiai saremashita!? ~Munou Reijou wa Kuni Ichiban no Kekkai Majutsushi ni Kaika suru~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja-ro": "Ane no Koto ga Sukina Hittou Majutsushi-sama ni Migawari de Totsuidara, Naze ka Watashi ga Dekiai saremashita!? ~Munou Reijou wa Kuni Ichiban no Kekkai Majutsushi ni Kaika suru~"
   },
   {
    "ja": "姉のことが好きな筆頭魔術師様に身代わりで嫁いだら、なぜか私が溺愛されました！？～無能令嬢は国一番の結界魔術師に開花する～"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Thetis, a countess, has been compared to her superior older sister and treated as incompetent by her family.\nOne day, she receives a proposal of engagement from Noah Savoid, the most famous magician in the country.\nShe wonders why she, who is so inconspicuous, should be asked to marry him. She wonders, “Noah loves me, but I have a fiancée, so he can't marry me. You should comfort him at best,” she tells him cruelly.\nShe marries into the Savoid family, but what awaits her there is the best of hospitality and overflowing doting love from Noah...⁉\nA love story of a dedicated hero and a doting duke."
  },
